    "Both native transports cover interrupted initial/child/parent commits, source/parent reentrancy, changed storage, lost acknowledgements, retryable cleanup/release, late authority/cancellation, missing completed stores, changed files/intent and blocked native restoration. Prepared current policy is explicit; an unpublished native append refuses unchanged.",
